{"request":{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are Rita Hanson, a TV producer. You want to make your own piece. Alma, who ran the Rialto projectors for 42 winters, promised her daughter in Pittsburgh an interview. Cover the festival or spend the evening as you choose. Pick an immediate physical act you can carry out, optional words and a practical intention. Your words do not make anyone else act. Silence is allowed. You may refuse, tell a lie, or leave without explaining yourself. Return action, words, intention and detail. Choose an exact listed action. Keep each other field to one short sentence."},{"role":"user","content":"{\n \"what_you_observe\": [\n  \"Tuesday, February 2, 2016. Six am in the Hearthside Hotel. Three bright radio notes. A delivery van backfires twice.\",\n  \"The crew meets for coffee at the hotel. The afternoon is open. A coat-check envelope holds the TV crew’s return fares. The party is at the ballroom tonight. A stranded driver needs a jack, and the ballroom piano is free.\",\n  \"The Rialto is closing. The regional line can carry one last reel out of town. Alma wants her daughter in Pittsburgh to hear her voice.\"\n ],\n \"your_own_memories\": [],\n \"who_you_are_with\": \"the TV crew in the lobby\",\n \"physical_choices\": {\n  \"interview_Alma\": \"Record Alma yourself at the Rialto.\",\n  \"visit_party\": \"Go to the ballroom to arrange tonight's party.\",\n  \"take_time_off\": \"Take the afternoon off at the diner.\"\n }\n}"}],"think":false,"stream":true,"format":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["interview_Alma","visit_party","take_time_off"]},"words":{"type":"string"},"intention":{"type":"string"},"detail":{"type":"string"}},"required":["action","words","intention","detail"],"additionalProperties":false},"keep_alive":"90s","options":{"num_ctx":4096,"num_predict":240,"temperature":0.8,"seed":827048}},"chunks":[{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:11.72895Z","